    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7566201",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "756620101",
                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                    "text": "A courier told me that our combat readiness liaison found an excellent certification officer."
                },
                {
                    "id": "756620102",
                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                    "text": "Turns out that it's you. An encouraging sign."
                },
                {
                    "id": "756620103",
                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                    "text": "Tsk, so they've even gone to YOU, of all people? Hey, Kinich, looks like freaks of a feather do flock together — this commission-freak never learned to say no either!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "756620104",
                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                    "text": "Oh, look. A new commission notification — \"to shut a noisy dragon up.\"",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "756620105",
                            "text": "Oh, that? I just posted it.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "756620106",
                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                    "text": "You... You... So that's how it's gonna be, huh? Ganging up on the Almighty Dragonlord... Just you wait!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756620109",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "#Anyway, back on topic, {NICKNAME}. We'd like your help certifying these stages. Their difficulty and balance should be up to par."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756620110",
                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                    "text": "Difficulty? Where? Pfft! Don't be ridiculous."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756620111",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "And what would you consider difficult? \"Have them randomly pick some halfwit partner before rappelling down a mountain blindfolded\"?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756620112",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "And perhaps you'd also make it so that they'd only have a ten-percent chance of getting a Yumkasaur buddy, with their other options being Avatars of Lava or Geo Slimes?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "756620113",
                                            "text": "That's practically begging for death.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620114",
                                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                                    "text": "Hah, haven't you been tagging along with my little lackey long enough to know that that's just what the Scions of the Canopy love doing? My suggestion's perfect for them."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620115",
                                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                                    "text": "Perhaps you'd like to give us a demonstration, then?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620120",
                                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                                    "text": "...Such trivial challenges are far beneath the Almighty Dragonlord's dignity. Just amuse yourselves however you please, peons!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620121",
                                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                                    "text": "In any case, Irade offered me a good rate. Here's to you finding enjoyment in the challenge — and receiving satisfactory payment.",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "756620122",
                                                            "text": "I'm looking forward to it!",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "756620124",
                                                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                                                    "text": "I wish you well."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "756620123",
                                                            "text": "Leave it to me, Kinich!"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "756620116",
                                            "text": "Oooh, now we're really talking...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620117",
                                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                                    "text": "Hark! Hark! Now here's a person of refined tastes — way better than yours, at least!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620118",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "But I'd love to watch Ajaw show us how a pro does it first."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756620119",
                                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                                    "text": "I second that motion, Ajaw. You are much more agile than the average challenger. And even if a monster gets lucky and lands a hit, not like you'll get smacked straight into an Ajaw-shaped hole in the ground, right?"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "756620107",
                            "text": "Oh, don't worry, you can handle that one later.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "756620108",
                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                    "text": "Hmph! Do you think such paltry flattery means that the Almighty Dragonlord will owe you one or something?"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}